        <h3>Our Story</h3>
        <p>
          Olympus Studios was founded to create a new kind of creative production studio —
          one where technology amplifies human creativity rather than replacing it.
          From the serene landscapes of Woodland Pond to the curiosity-driven
          world of One Minute Wonders to the mysteries of Shadow Files, every
          production is crafted with care, purpose, and intelligence.
        </p>
        <p>
          We are a solo-operated studio backed by intelligent production systems
          that allow us to produce at a scale that would typically require a team
          of dozens. This is the future of creative production.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>
          To create stories that matter — for families, for a global audience,
          with purpose. We believe in the power of narrative to educate, inspire,
          and connect people across cultures and generations.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every production is a step toward a more creative, more informed,
          more connected world.
        </p>
      </div>
